# Release / test scratch
# Anchored to the repo root: this rule is for throwaway release metadata dumps
# like release-v2.1.0.json. Release evidence and policy under docs/ (for
# example docs/release-tag-ruleset.json and the branch-protection verification
# results) must stay tracked.
/release-*.json
test_bulk_keys.txt
test_dashboard_format.txt

# VS Code extension build output
vscode-pushkey/*.vsix
.vercel
